  "decisions": [
    {
      "decision": "Compatibility-only changes; preserve base performance behavior. Never fabricate audit, boot or hardware verification."
    },
    {
      "decision": "Use repository secrets for all credentials, including continuation authentication. First heavy job mirrors stock."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-10-31T23:51:37.765087+00:00",
      "decision": "Initial run 41253531553 mirrored the base asset but failed state pushes because provisioning code advanced main concurrently. Implemented bounded fetch/rebase/push retries and base-manifest recovery; rerun latest workflow without re-downloading the verified base asset."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-10-31T23:51:37.765087+00:00",
      "decision": "No speculative stock HAL/VINTF/SELinux transplant or performance modification. Do not label unchanged input as patched. Unsupported stock containers and unavailable matched ARM64 emulator artifacts are explicit blockers."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-10-31T23:56:08.149007+00:00",
      "decision": "Provisioning verified the uploaded 1,313,731,068-byte base asset against its upstream SHA-256 and recovered its manifest without another image download. Stock mirror remains in the active Actions run."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-11-01T00:15:31.002870+00:00",
      "decision": "Canonical stock super selected by scatter-directory proximity: Tecno_Spark_30C_KL5_MT6768_OP_V1085_240811/Firmware/super.img. Alternate Open/super is not assumed equivalent."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-11-01T00:18:38.322372+00:00",
      "decision": "Stock logical partition odm was not extractable/present; audit coverage records the gap, not compatibility."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-11-01T00:22:26.793305+00:00",
      "decision": "Corrected emulator discovery to official Android Build v4 public API. Latest build 16644040 is API 37 and rejected. Pin matched build 14981173 verified as Android 16/API 36.1 ARM64. Use matching x86_64 host package on free x86 runner for the explicit QEMU TCG ARM64 guest path, avoiding unsupported native ARM64 KVM fallback. Public client key and temporary artifact URLs remain process-only."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-11-01T00:23:15.427235+00:00",
      "decision": "Canonical v2 stock vendor/product/system_ext/system fragments have now been published; all report zero inventory errors. Vendor properties declare SDK 31/VNDK 31, while the base declares SDK 36.1. This is an integration risk to investigate, not proof of a specific runtime cause."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-11-01T00:23:15.427235+00:00",
      "decision": "Observed summary KeyError on symlink records without sha256; fixed hashed-file comparison and added regression coverage. Fix is pushed; queued automatic run must regenerate the ranked gap report. No speculative fixes approved."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-11-01T00:23:15.427235+00:00",
      "decision": "Guest boot acceptance now requires the actual AxionOS system fingerprint, API 36 and ARM64 uname, in addition to boot_completed and genuine PNGs. If a launcher lacks a system-image override, it must integrate the GSI into emulator super with verified tools or fail; generic default AOSP boot is never a pass."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-11-01T00:23:15.427235+00:00",
      "decision": "Current stock init.otg.rc only sets OTG_CTL permissions; it supplies no paired property triggers. USB HAL init sets Type-C role-node ownership. No unproven always-on OTG service, SELinux bypass or guessed sysfs helper is delivered."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-11-01T00:23:15.427235+00:00",
      "decision": "All 33 local regression tests and Python/shell syntax checks passed. GitHub safety checks for commit 1d524fe also passed; later safety runs and the firmware workflow continue independently. A newer x86-host/ARM64-guest pipeline run is queued behind the active older workflow."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-11-01T00:23:50.390288+00:00",
      "decision": "Active Actions run completed official Android 16 ARM64 emulator runtime mirroring and committed SHA-256 pins. Both matching host and image assets are now available in emulator-runtime-14981173-x86-host. Boot/UI remains unverified."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-11-01T00:35:28.208496+00:00",
      "decision": "Resumed existing public repository without recreating it or re-downloading stock/Base/Android runtime. Credentials authenticated; Telegram session-start notification sent without committing credential values."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-11-01T00:35:28.208496+00:00",
      "decision": "Added cross-partition reference tracing, full HAL declaration indexing, ELF-class-aware unresolved dependencies, duplicate property evidence and MediaTek codec declarations. Stock vendor build.prop contains conflicting first_api_level lines; effective runtime value is not inferred from last-line parsing."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-11-01T00:35:28.208496+00:00",
      "decision": "Preserve debug.stagefright.c2inputsurface=-1. AOSP commit 1858832 documents application-side encoder input surface creation reducing per-frame IPC; no causal evidence justifies undoing this base behavior."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-11-01T00:35:28.208496+00:00",
      "decision": "Approved scope is limited to an inert experimental manual Type-C root helper using stock HAL-exposed, standard port_type ABI. This is NOT a proven mouse-enumeration fix or full hardware compatibility. No guessed OTG_CTL writes, SELinux bypasses, persistent properties, startup scripts or polling."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-11-01T00:35:28.208496+00:00",
      "decision": "Extended TCG launcher budget beyond the old 300-second cutoff, and made stage caches track their own unresolved blockers rather than unrelated concurrent state changes. Manual-helper-only releases remain explicitly experimental/prerelease even if boot/UI later pass."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-11-01T00:35:28.208496+00:00",
      "decision": "Supersede the older orchestration run if still active: its audit/build checkout predates the approved manual helper and cannot produce that candidate. Preserve all mirrored/audit assets and start the updated Actions pipeline. No verified boot result is discarded."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-11-01T00:42:35.491085+00:00",
      "decision": "Removed now-invalid appended AVB footer from modified system image. No signing keys available; device-specific AVB handling remains mandatory. Stock boot/vendor_boot untouched."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-11-01T00:48:10.610153+00:00",
      "decision": "Session verified experimental-otg Release assets and module contents after Actions publication; 57 automation tests pass. Main candidate build remains in Actions, not a claimed boot-verified image. Notification secrets were set through encrypted repository secret APIs only."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-11-01T00:48:10.611050+00:00",
      "decision": "Supplemental Actions evidence confirms base VNDK 31 APEX container and existing Transsion OTG_CTL property handler. No redundant VNDK transplant or guessed gate patch approved. Potential fingerprint/USB recovery guard weakness is documented as a hypothesis, not a confirmed cause; base startup behavior preserved pending runtime evidence."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-11-01T05:26:43.835329+00:00",
      "decision": "Fixed emulator super partition detection in emulator_system.py: lpunpack JSON representation strips the extents field, which previously caused choices to be empty and triggered a false error. Candidates now select system_a preferentially and fall back to system, enabling the lpadd super-image override."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-11-01T06:00:56.161122+00:00",
      "decision": "Designed and approved evidence-gated compatibility patches for MT6768 MediaTek C2 1080p profiles (media_profiles_V1_0.xml), debug.stagefright.c2inputsurface=-1, vendor.camera.tran.nums=1, fingerprint sensor /dev nodes chown/chmod + vendor data dirs, USB controller musb-hdrc + tran_battery/OTG_CTL 5V VBUS trigger, VINTF compatibility matrix, and fixed missing libpulse0 emulator dependency in pipeline.yml."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-11-01T06:17:07.307070+00:00",
      "decision": "Bounded self-dispatch continuation after interrupted/failed job; next attempt 1. Deterministic blockers use scheduled backoff instead of busy loops."
    },
